          "content": "Cha's mother (b.1922 Yongjing, Manchuria). Triple-language speaker under colonial rule: Korean forbidden, Japanese enforced, Chinese ambient. Her experience of linguistic displacement under colonial rule is a central narrative thread in the text.",
