          "content": "Prophetess who sees truth but is not believed. Parallel to diseuse de bonne aventure (fortune-teller). Both speak truth that existing power structures refuse to hear. Connected to Spivak's 'Can the Subaltern Speak?'",
          "classified_as": "scope_note"
        }
      ],
      "dict:evidenceType": "Textual",
      "dict:chapter": [
        "MELPOMENE",
        "ELITERE"
      ],
      "dict:pageReference": "p.88, 123"
    },
