          "content": "Pro-democracy uprising in Gwangju, South Korea, May 1980, brutally suppressed by military forces. Cha visited Korea shortly after and witnessed the aftermath. Referenced in the text as a moment of political crisis and historical repetition.",
          "classified_as": "description"
        },
        {
          "type": "LinguisticObject",
          "content": "1980 pro-democracy movement brutally suppressed. Cha (age 29) returned to Korea, witnessed aftermath. 'Nothing has changed, we are at a standstill.' (p.87). Third iteration of national self-division after 1919, 1960.",
          "classified_as": "scope_note"
        }
      ],
